                             see the starfield/shape of Earth, and              
                             the horizon dips down by                           
                             3.1\\u00b0.\\n\\nBut for most people in            
                             planes, they\'re looking straight out              
                             (level), and the horizon looks                     
                             perfectly flat because... \\n\\nOh! I              
