                             is 4 feet \\u00d7 tan(3\\u00b0) \\u2248            
                             4 \\u00d7 0.052 = 0.21 feet. That\'s               
                             2.5 inches. You can\'t see that with               
                             your eye alone.\\n\\nBut you also                  
                             can\'t see the horizon where it dips               
                             below your window, because your window             
                             is small. You see the horizon line                 
                             which is the set of points on Earth                
                             visible simultaneously. \\n\\nHmm, let             
                             me reconsider the geometry. Actually,              
                             when I sit in a plane and look out the             
                             window, I see a 2D image. The bottom of            
