                             Beyond that, you can\'t see the                    
                             surface. But you might see an object               
                             *at* the horizon if it\'s at the right             
                             angle.\\n\\nBut Rowbotham\'s specific              
                             claim is that he saw the flag move 6               
                             miles down the river and it didn\'t                
