                             observation, but modern analysis shows             
                             that the drop is too small to matter at            
                             6 miles, and more importantly, the                 
                             framing of the question is                         
                             reversed.\\n\\nActually, wait. I want              
                             to verify the geometry of what he\'s               
                             claiming. There\'s a famous figure from            
                             Flat Earth museum/history. Let me                  
                             reconstruct:\\n\\nThe Old Bedford River            
