                             2 = 6371 * 0.001729 = 11 km. So the                
                             surface drops about 11 km below the                
                             tangent plane at the horizon. That\'s              
                             significant, but the line of sight to              
                             the horizon is not straight down; it\'s            
                             angled.\\n\\nThis is getting                       
                             complicated. Simpler explanation: At               
                             35,000 ft, the visible \\"floor\\" of              
                             the atmosphere is effectively infinite,            
                             so you see the sky. The horizon is                 
                             hidden by clouds or by the fact that               
