                             where sky meets Earth. Because the                 
                             Earth is below you, the \\"horizon\\"              
                             is a circle around you. But from the               
                             window, you see a dome of sky that                 
                             gradually fades. The curvature of the              
                             horizon is not obvious because you                 
                             can\'t see the far side of                         
                             Earth.\\n\\nWait, if the Earth is below            
                             the window, you can\'t see the Earth\'s            
